  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It is the second part of ticket: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2742"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2742",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Modify the algorithm for collecting authorizations so that all authorizations are read from the file pointed to by the rel=acl link associated with a resource.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The task is to check at ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-auth-webac/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/auth/webac/WebACRolesProvider.java#L368"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-auth-webac/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/auth/webac/WebACRolesProvider.java#L368",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " and modify the algorithm to get hash resources unless `FedoraResource.getChildren()` also gets hash URI children, in which case nevermind.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The overall workflow would like this: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://gist.github.com/yinlinchen/13c9a3f2c0bdb8dc7cf06bf060f3c520"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://gist.github.com/yinlinchen/13c9a3f2c0bdb8dc7cf06bf060f3c520",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
