  "description": "<p>It is the second part of ticket: <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2742\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2742</a></p>\n\n<p>Modify the algorithm for collecting authorizations so that all authorizations are read from the file pointed to by the rel=acl link associated with a resource.</p>\n\n<p>The task is to check at <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-auth-webac/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/auth/webac/WebACRolesProvider.java#L368\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-auth-webac/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/auth/webac/WebACRolesProvider.java#L368</a> and modify the algorithm to get hash resources unless `FedoraResource.getChildren()` also gets hash URI children, in which case nevermind.</p>\n\n<p>The overall workflow would like this: <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/yinlinchen/13c9a3f2c0bdb8dc7cf06bf060f3c520\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://gist.github.com/yinlinchen/13c9a3f2c0bdb8dc7cf06bf060f3c520</a> </p>",
